From 621753c702fb9b61376e70f6c71ef1ea340d22cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:32:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 56/97] system: optional host-backed utility drive
 (--mount_cache, default off) for the title's cache: partition

Mounts <user_data_root>/cache_drive as \Device\Harddisk0\Cache0 = cache: when enabled; reports real host free space.
With it, WWE 13 creates cache:\EditEx.cac (400 MB) and cache:\Spectacular.rps (150 MB); no behaviour difference was
found in an A/B (docs/W6-CACHE-DRIVE.md in the game repo), so it stays off. Default path unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
